Reused or adapted material includes the column-major math helpers, seeded
random generator, WebGL mesh/shader/buffer infrastructure, standard Xbox
input handling, Web Audio synthesis and music scheduling, static build/check
scripts, scope-isolated service worker, and offline regression harness.

Modifications for PULL: original clay range, shotgun and hinged reload model,
pellet tracing, doubling rounds, reload-sensitive scoring, menus/HUD,
procedural sound cues/music arrangement, tests and documentation.

No proprietary game assets, weapon brands, downloaded sound recordings,
external textures, or third-party runtime packages are used.
